  "rationale": "The constraints are met and the Pareto front is well-established. The minimum area design (iterative, 6860 um^2) satisfies the throughput constraint (9.43 MSPS >= 1) and the accuracy constraint (10.1 bits >= 10). The front covers a reasonable range of the accuracy objective (10.1 to 11.6 bits) and area (6860 to 13980 um^2). Since this is the final round, we stop. The selection rule (min area) will pick the iterative design with 6860 um^2."
}
